{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34130","headline":"杂体诗 胥口即事六言二首 二 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 胥口即事六言二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂钓清风细丽，飘蓑暑雨霏微。\n湖云欲散未散，屿鸟将飞不飞。\n换酒帩头把看，载莲艇子撑归。\n斯人到死还乐，谁道刚须用机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}